  description: "[Flip this card over when you activate this Skill.]\r\n\r\nActivate
    this Skill during your Main Phase, while you control \"Black Luster Soldier\"
    or \"Magician of Black Chaos\" that you Ritual Summoned this turn.\r\n\u25CF
    While you control \"Black Luster Soldier\", it cannot be destroyed by your opponent's
    Skill, also once per turn, if your opponent activates a Trap Card, draw 1 card
    immediately after it resolves.\r\n\u25CF While you control \"Magician of Black
    Chaos\", it cannot be destroyed by your opponent's Spell effects, also if your
    \"Magician of Black Chaos\" destroys a monster by battle, add 1 Spell from your
    GY to your hand."
